<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's Boulton Q1 adjusted profit.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's Boulton Q1 adjusted profit.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 91.50 million bolivars vs 466 million loss</p>
<p>Total costs 2.52 bln bolivars vs 6.07 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Revenues 2.62 bln bolivars vs 5.60 bln bolivars</p>
<p>NOTES: Results are inflation-adjusted in constant September 30, 1996 bolivars.</p>
<p>Accounts are consolidated.</p>
<p>Venezuelan's H.L. Boulton and Co SACA is a holding company.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
